              "hash": "X-Amz-Target=PaymentCryptographyControlPlane.StopKeyUsage"
            },
            "description": "<p>Disables an Amazon Web Services Payment Cryptography key, which makes it inactive within Amazon Web Services Payment Cryptography.</p> <p>You can use this operation instead of <a>DeleteKey</a> to deactivate a key. You can enable the key in the future by calling <a>StartKeyUsage</a>.</p> <p> <b>Cross-account use:</b> This operation can't be used across different Amazon Web Services accounts.</p> <p> <b>Related operations:</b> </p> <ul> <li> <p> <a>DeleteKey</a> </p> </li> <li> <p> <a>StartKeyUsage</a> </p> </li> </ul>"
